              "printed_page": 632,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Between 60% and 70% of the liver can be",
              "pdf_page": 714,
              "printed_page": 632,
              "column": 2,
              "subheading": "Abdominal Ultrasonography"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "May identify discrete mass effect with variable",
              "pdf_page": 714,
              "printed_page": 632,
              "column": 2,
              "subheading": "Abdominal Ultrasonography"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "resected if the patient is healthy, and",
